  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Programme for Education, Advocacy, Counselling &amp; Economic Empowerment</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A program working on Education, Advocacy, Counselling and Economic Empowerment in the refugee settlements of Northern Uganda ( Palorinya, Bidi Bidi, Kiryadongo refugee settlements). The focus areas will be on Inclusive Education, Economic Empowerment and Psychosocial Support for South Sudanese Refugee Communities. The program will be led by a consortium of Str&#xf8;mmestiftelsen/Str&#xf8;mme Foundation as lead application and YGlobal and Adventist Developmnet and Relief Agency International (ADRA) as Co- applicant.</narrative>
  </description>
